## Not installable by Homebrew ###############################################
#
# Built from source here (signed with the personal identity):
#   AeroSpace       ~/.local/bin/aerospace + /Applications/AeroSpace.app
#   Jarvis          dev.domguy.jarvis
#   MusicMenu       ~/personal/mac-utils/music-menu-app
#   Turnout         io.turnout.router
#   UsageLens       com.rahulbhatt.UsageLens (FnH signing)
#
# Direct downloads with no cask:
#   Clicky          com.humansongs.clicky
#   Orca            com.stablyai.orca (the `orca` cask is a different app)
#   Paper           com.todesktop.2601167vjw8xe (the `paper` cask is Pap.er)
#   PetitPlayer     com.joonyoung.petit-player
#   T3 Code (Alpha) the `t3-code` cask only ships the Beta
#
# Work-managed (installed by IT):
#   Check Point Endpoint Security VPN, Check Point Firewall
#
# Steam games (~/Applications): Dead Cells, GRIS, Neva
